# hran_elementmanager2g

[![Documentation](https://docs.taf.ute.nsn-rdnet.net/projects/hran_elementmanager2g/badge/)][1]
[![Requirements](https://taf.wrgitlab-pages.int.net.nokia.com/miscellaneous/static-badges/requirements.svg)](requirements/base.txt)
[![build status](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/panda-libraries/hran_elementmanager2g/badges/main/pipeline.svg)][2]
[![coverage report](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/panda-libraries/hran_elementmanager2g/badges/main/coverage.svg)][2]
[![latest release](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/panda-libraries/hran_elementmanager2g/-/badges/release.svg)][3]

MBB HetRAN TA hran_elementmanager2g library for 2G Flexi BTS Site Manager Emulator.
This library allows control of 2G BCF through a locally connected PC via m_bts protocol.

## Supported Python versions

Library should work properly with Python versions specified within
`python_requires` option in [setup.py](setup.py).

## Installation

Generic library installation process is described in [TAF user guide][4].


